  "visible_text": "CAST LABORATORY / COUPLED CONTACT TEST\nWalk the linked red and blue contacts through both engraved groove plates, then release the brass shoe only when both exit channels are clear.\n\nOne rigid shoe. Two plates. A move is legal only when both contacts stay in their visible grooves.\n\nCHALLENGE\n3590236BEC39A9\nFULL INPUT\nREAR PLATE\nTIP PLATE\nREAR NUB\nTIP NUB\nEXIT CHANNEL\nWALL / FORBIDDEN\nLINKAGE CONSOLE\nTIP / BLUE\nCONTROL MODE\nTRANSLATION\nmoves 18 / 60\nFULL INPUT\nTAB\nchoose nub\n`\nchange mode\n\u2191 / \u2193\nout / in (translation)\n\u2190 / \u2192\ncounterclockwise / clockwise\nRotation mode: arrows turn the shoe about the active nub.\nREAR CONTACT\nr 177 \u00b7 11\u00b0\nCLEAR\nTIP CONTACT\nr 167 \u00b7 -128\u00b0\nCLEAR\nWALL STOP\nIf either contact crosses a dark wall, the command stops and the shoe stays put. Re-inspect both plates before the next move.\n\u21ba RESET SHOE\nPASS\nRELEASE THE SEAL\nDUAL EXIT TRAJECTORY ACCEPTED\nPASS"
